Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 17:44:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Duo: keep the Launcher3 Duo-DE modifications off the hinge
 (DuoPanels)

Replace the 1344 / 2500 / 1394 literals with the panel rects from DuoPanelGeometry:
- the spanned test (widthPx > 2500) in DeviceProfile and WorkspaceTouchListener
- the left/right screen of a touch (x < 1344), now by the hinge centre
- the all-apps sheet, exactly one screen wide (was half the display minus 5 px, 28 px into the hinge)
- the freeform launch rect for the right screen (started at x=1394, 16 px inside the hinge, and 116 px
  short of the screen edge): now the screen rect inset by 50 px

New helper util/DuoPanels. Needs frameworks_base DuoPanelGeometry.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: I3f4dcfcac19c7263f395a416f0d993af1112473b
